{"uid":"8b7968aad3dd1275","name":"test_the_shared_launcher_zeroes_the_backoff_unless_the_test_names_one","fullName":"tests.test_stub_pi_harness#test_the_shared_launcher_zeroes_the_backoff_unless_the_test_names_one","historyId":"52c2898ce848b60e443974e17a33cf3b","time":{"start":1791925662022,"stop":1791925662023,"duration":1},"description":"The other half of the first clause, behaviourally: `LiveRun` (the one\n    launcher behind `live`/`engine_factory`) writes an all-zero schedule into\n    every job.yaml it generates, and yields the WHOLE setting -- both knobs --\n    to a test that names either half of it, in the job dict or in `stub_env`\n    (a spawned engine's env wins over its job.yaml, and a `max_s` of 0.0\n    would cap an env-named schedule back to zero). Task 003 (#278 B.5): the\n    same helper also defaults `route_task_selection` to `False` (unless the\n    job dict already names it), unconditionally -- that default is not\n    paired with any env knob the way the backoff schedule is.","descriptionHtml":"<p>The other half of the first clause, behaviourally: <code>LiveRun</code> (the one<br />\nlauncher behind <code>live</code>/<code>engine_factory</code>) writes an all-zero schedule into<br />\nevery job.yaml it generates, and yields the WHOLE setting -- both knobs --<br />\nto a test that names either half of it, in the job dict or in <code>stub_env</code><br />\n(a spawned engine's env wins over its job.yaml, and a <code>max_s</code> of 0.0<br />\nwould cap an env-named schedule back to zero). Task 003 (#278 B.5): the<br />\nsame helper also defaults <code>route_task_selection</code> to <code>False</code> (unless the<br />\njob dict already names it), unconditionally -- that default is not<br />\npaired with any env knob the way the backoff schedule is.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791